  "notes": {
    "ㄱ": "At the end, a clipped k. Before a vowel it carries over as g. Before ㄴ or ㅁ it becomes ng. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㄲ": "At the end, the same clipped k as ㄱ. Before a vowel the tense kk carries over. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅋ": "At the end, a clipped k. Before a vowel the breathy k carries over. Before ㄴ or ㅁ it becomes ng. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㄴ": "Always n, and it carries over before a vowel. Next to ㄹ it turns into l.",
    "ㄷ": "At the end, a clipped t. Before a vowel it carries over as d, but before 이 it becomes j. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㄹ": "At the end, an l. Before a vowel it carries over as a light r. A ㄴ right after it also turns into l.",
    "ㅁ": "Always m, and it carries over before a vowel.",
    "ㅂ": "At the end, a clipped p. Before a vowel it carries over as b. Before ㄴ or ㅁ it becomes m. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅅ": "At the end, a clipped t, not s. Before a vowel the s comes back. Before ㄴ or ㅁ it becomes n. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅆ": "At the end, a clipped t. Before a vowel the tense ss comes back. Before ㄴ it becomes n. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅇ": "At the end, ng. It stays put and does not carry over to a following vowel.",
    "ㅈ": "At the end, a clipped t. Before a vowel the j comes back. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅊ": "At the end, a clipped t. Before a vowel the ch comes back. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅌ": "At the end, a clipped t. Before a vowel the t carries over, but before 이 it becomes ch. Before ㄴ it becomes n. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅍ": "At the end, a clipped p. Before a vowel the p carries over. Before ㄴ or ㅁ it becomes m. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㅎ": "Silent before a vowel. Before ㄷ, ㄱ or ㅈ it adds a puff of air (ㄷ becomes ㅌ). Before ㄴ it becomes n, and before ㅅ it makes ㅆ.",
    "ㄳ": "Only the ㄱ is heard at the end. Before a vowel the ㅅ carries over as a tense ㅆ. A plain ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅅ ㅈ right after it turns tense (ㄲ ㄸ ㅃ ㅆ ㅉ).",
    "ㄵ": "Only the ㄴ is heard at the end. Before a vowel the ㅈ carries over. At the end of a verb stem, a ㄷ right after it turns tense (ㄸ).",
